 The old hermit says: "Here we don't fight. Down in the arena, you may. The rats have the run of
 the pit again, and their squeaking comes up the stairs all night. Kill three of them for --more--




                  ┌─ The old hermit ─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │                                                              │
                  │ "Here we don't fight. Down in the arena, you may. The rats   │
